  "job_B9.6.4_20251003_115050": {
    "chunk_text": "from sumum h\u00e6\u00f0num \u00deonon \u00fea seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 \u00fereo gear ful in gedwolan w\u00e6s lifiende, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t Sigeberht Eorpwaldes Se mon w\u00e6s \u00feurh eall se cristenesta & se gel\u00e6redesta; w\u00e6s he be \u00feam bre\u00feer lifigendum wrecca \u00de\u00e6s geleafan he wolde his leode d\u00e6lnimende gedon, sona \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he to rice feng; & his \u00fe\u00e6m Cwom he \u00e6rest hider ofer s\u00e6 to Honorie \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6rcebiscope; & him s\u00e6gde his willan & his lust. \u00dea sende he hine godcunde lare to l\u00e6ranne in Eastengle. Ond he sona se arf\u00e6sta bigenga \u00fe\u00e6s gastlican londes micelne w\u00e6stm gemette in \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeode & he ealle \u00fea \u00f0eode \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m geryne his noman from longre wenisse & unges\u00e6lignesse Onfeng he biscopse\u00f0l in Dommocceastre; ond mid \u00fey \u00fee he seofontyne winter in biscoplicum L\u00e6rde he Sanctus Paulinus se biscop eac swelce Godes word in Lindesse, seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 is seo Ond \u00fea \u00e6rest to Drihtnes geleafan gecerde Lindcylene ceastre gerefan, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Bl\u00e6cca, Swelce he in \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre st\u00e6nenne cirican getimbrede \u00e6\u00f0eles geweorces, \u00fe\u00e6re gen to d\u00e6ge In \u00fe\u00e6re seolfan cirican Sanctus Paulinus se biscop, \u00fea Iustus se biscop to Criste leorde , Bi \u00feisse m\u00e6g\u00f0e geleafan, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he Beda, me s\u00e6gde sum arwyr\u00f0e m\u00e6ssepreost & abbud of Cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, \u00fe\u00e6t him s\u00e6gde sum eald weota, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6",
